    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a \"break\" or a chance to start over. it just feels final. there’s this weird stillness at the edge, you know? like the wind finally stopped. it's so quiet here. it feels more honest than the struggle of trying to find a way through the fog.",
